    17	/**
    18	 * The auditorium is a CSS grid with 28 tracks per row: track 1 is the left row label, tracks
    19	 * 2–5 are columns 1–4, track 6 is the left aisle, tracks 7–22 are columns 5–20, track 23 is the
    20	 * right aisle, tracks 24–27 are columns 21–24 and track 28 is the right row label.
    21	 */
